# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
## PVT Reservoir Fluids Division – Integrated Administrative Management System

Act as a Senior Python Software Architect, Full-Stack Developer, Database Designer, UI/UX Designer, and Enterprise Application Security Engineer.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, professional, production-ready administrative management system for the **Reservoir Fluids Division (PVT Laboratory)** of a major oil company.

The application must manage all administrative activities, employees, equipment, documents, reports, correspondence, inventory, maintenance, and internal operations of the division.

**IMPORTANT: This is an administrative management system ONLY. It is NOT a petroleum engineering calculation or PVT laboratory analysis application. Do not implement PVT calculations, thermodynamic models, fluid-property calculations, CME, CCE, CVD, DLE, EOS, or other laboratory analysis algorithms.**

The system should be reliable, visually sophisticated, secure, modular, easy to maintain, and suitable for daily use in an oil company environment.

